{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 World Heart Day, 29 September\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b Maroma Cafe marked World Heart Day on 29 September with a note on food and daily care, tying the health of the heart to what people choose to put on the plate.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The cafe is a vegan kitchen on Aspiration Street, Auroville.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 It said meals are made from chosen ingredients, with the aim that they nourish and still feel like a pleasure. Mindful dining, as the kitchen put it, means pausing, choosing with attention, and tasting what is on the plate.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 There is no online order page. Visitors are directed to the Auroville address.\par}
