{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 The Magic Carpet is open until 17 October\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b The Magic Carpet, a Tiny Artist Project by Gallery Maji and the Women Builder Collective, is on view on Aspiration Street, Auroville, from 4 to 17 October, 9am to 5pm.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The exhibition is curated by Supriya Menon Meneghetti. The opening was at 4.30pm on 3 October.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 Workshops run with the show. Waste-fabric art is on 11 and 18 October, Sundays from 10am to 12pm. Dorodango is on 10 and 17 October, Saturdays from 10am to 1pm.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 Workshop enquiries: tinyartistproject@gmail.com or womenbuildercollective@gmail.com. The venue is shared with Maroma and Maji on Aspiration Street.\par}
