{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 Maroma at BIOFACH India\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b Maroma exhibited at BIOFACH India and met partners, customers, and other members of the organic trade, using the stand to show its products, craft, and working methods.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The company said it spoke with visitors about how the goods are made.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 It described the fair as a chance to meet people who already care how things are grown and produced.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 Maroma thanked those who came to the booth, spoke with the team, and spent time at the stand.\par}
