{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 Ninth-grade students visit the workshop\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b Maroma hosted a group of ninth-grade students for a workshop on natural fragrance, craft, and how products are made, taking them from raw ingredients to the steps behind a finished piece.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The visit included hands-on work at the benches.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The company said the group brought curiosity and questions to the workshop.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 It said it will share more from the day.\par}
