{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 World Coconut Day: oil used across the range\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b For World Coconut Day, Maroma said it uses home-grown, certified organic coconut oil in skincare, haircare, bodycare, and home products, treating the oil as a regular material on the bench rather than a limited edition.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 Coconut has long been used in daily life in India for food, care, and household work.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The company said the oil helps soften, protect, and replenish skin and hair, which is why it appears across several ranges.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The coconut collection is listed on maroma.com.\par}
