{\pard\keepn\sb800\sa180\fs34\b\cf1 Teachers' Day\par}
{\pard\sl400\slmult1\sb40\sa220\fs26\b Maroma marked Teachers' Day by thanking people who teach, beginning with classroom teachers and then naming children, friends, and colleagues as people who teach as well.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 The note described teachers as people who guide, encourage curiosity, and help others see further.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 It said the thanks was for teaching in large ways and small ones.\par}
{\pard\sl380\slmult1\sb80\sa180 No product was offered with the message.\par}
